@socialist_education
title: Socialist Education
subtitle: 1 R and a working TUR; Lewica +6 strength and −5 dissent; for six months the flow of workers from PPS to the KPP is halved.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'czapinski', 'socialist_education').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_socialist_education_why +]
